/* Brazilian Portuguese, machine-seeded 2026-08-28. TRANSLATOR REVIEW PENDING.

   The permission prompts iOS and macOS draw before Braid has run a line of
   Dart. They cannot come from `lib/l10n/*.arb`: the system reads them straight
   out of the bundle, keyed by the `Info.plist` key each one overrides.

   Keep them keyed against the English in `Info.plist` — a key here that is not
   there is dead, and a key there that is missing here falls back to English,
   which is a permission prompt in the wrong language on a screen the user
   cannot get past. `l10n_test.dart` checks both directions. */

"NSLocationUsageDescription" = "O Weft compartilha sua localização apenas quando você toca em \"compartilhar localização\" em uma conversa.";
